# No sweep needed; SEED 9 stays pinned. Two follow-up netlists on the same branch
# also closed SEED 9 first roll: the 0.1c version bump (89.89/90.60,
# DVD_launchfb_20260826_0354.rbf) and the idle-widescreen ARX fix (39,028 ALM,
# 87.48/92.09 - tighter hot corner but PASS -> DVD_launchfb_20260826_0417.rbf =
